        "created_at": "2016-02-01T23:14:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<div>On the right track, and finally pinned down over on Steam. Thanks to the investigative work here and on the <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/app/337150/discussions/0/451852225134831851\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Steam forums</a>, the unlock conditions for Freedom Six Absolute Zero have been determined by the community. Well done everyone!</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><strong>Lose a game to Iron Legacy with regular Absolute Zero on the team. Then, defeat any villain with regular Absolute Zero and without a Legacy on the team. Each of Absolute Zero’s equipment cards must be destroyed at least once, and he may not be incapacitated.</strong></div>",
