        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ebca7d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-02T17:19:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Weird. &nbsp;I unlocked him at home without any issues.</p><p>I cannot unlock him at work at all. &nbsp;I've met all the requirements. &nbsp;The only thing might be I have another F6 member on the team, but I think I had Tempest or Unity when I unlocked him previously.</p><p>I've let Iron Legacy beatdown all the F6 (so I don't have to do it again for other unlocks).</p><p>All 4 equipment has been destroyed via Dark Watch Fixer.</p><p>Absolute Zero is alive.</p><p>Legacy is not on this team.</p><p>Defeated the villain.</p>",
