        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/ebca7d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-02T17:22:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>WEIRD!</p><p>I see what happened now. &nbsp;Steam carried over my unlock from home into my work laptop. &nbsp;He was already unlocked. &nbsp;It didn't used to do that.</p><p>But what's more weird is that I checked to see if they were unlocked when I first played this morning, and they were locked. &nbsp;But now, they are unlocked.</p><p>Interesting.</p>",
