        "created_at": "2016-02-02T20:03:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes. All four both times.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>EDIT: The first time I had all four in play when Villain Omnitron hit us with a destroy all equipment. In the other game, &nbsp;I had destroyed cryo chamber with its power, and then had Omniton X do a sigularity on the other 3 pieces of equipment. And with each of these games, I'd previously lost to Iron Legacy with him on the team, so I should have two losses (at least) of that in the history.</p>",
