        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bunston/{size}/1939_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-03T00:17:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Jimeni\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/77aa72/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jimeni:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yes. All four both times.&nbsp;EDIT: The first time I had all four in play when Villain Omnitron hit us with a destroy all equipment. In the other game, &nbsp;I had destroyed cryo chamber with its power, and then had Omniton X do a sigularity on the other 3 pieces of equipment. And with each of these games, I'd previously lost to Iron Legacy with him on the team, so I should have two losses (at least) of that in the history.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Was Legacy on your team?</p>",
        "post_number": 30,
