        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jimb/{size}/2093_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-04T00:07:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Argent Adept, Omnitron-X, Absolute Zero, and the Scholar versus Gloomweaver in the Time Cataclysm.  Just about every turn was spent making Zero draw or play until all his stuff was out because I didn’t feel like waiting; then I killed all four equipment cards with a “Singularity” (twice, actually, since this particular group is a reeeaaaaal slow build on damage).  The second “Singularity” destroyed all villain cards.  Zero’s new form, Elemental Wrath or whatever, was unlocked.</p>",
