        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/armadagon/{size}/2379_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-05T14:27:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had an interesting glitch during my streaming session last night. &nbsp;Classic Wraith, TLT, Unity, Visionary, and AZ vs Chairman at Wagner. &nbsp;Attempting to get triple unlock for Wraith, Unity, and AZ. &nbsp;Unity gets incapped thanks to Oxygen Leak and me being terrible at math. &nbsp;More importantly, Wraith kills the Chairman via Inventory Barrage while the Operative is still active and I get the F6 Absolute Zero unlock despite not winning the game. &nbsp;I'll have the video up over the weekend to show.</p>",
